                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0337f8ba-9827-3104-a493-a776dfcd03eb",
                        "entry_id": "f402206f-dcfa-328b-9f09-43695657ff83",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. сигнализировать, отображать что-либо на индикаторе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2323aa7e-5bc0-4615-b318-18407204f02f",
                                "sense_id": "0337f8ba-9827-3104-a493-a776dfcd03eb",
                                "text": "Согласно этому распоряжению, все компании, предоставляющие услуги мобильной связи по стандарту GSM, на время проведения праздников в Питере отключили кодировку, затрудняющую прослушку мобильников. 〈…〉 На запросы тех пользователей, чьи аппараты индицируют отсутствие защиты, операторы отвечали, что это вызвано плановой заменой программного обеспечения коммутаторов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "613edb9d-d8ff-4d50-b2e2-dc0bf76cbaed",
                                "sense_id": "0337f8ba-9827-3104-a493-a776dfcd03eb",
                                "text": "Действительно, при полном выходном диапазоне этой микросхемы, который составляет число ±1999, нужно подключать 4 индикатора, однако старший из них будет индицировать только цифру."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61685d5b-d871-4a99-8afa-610bf988e50c",
                                "sense_id": "0337f8ba-9827-3104-a493-a776dfcd03eb",
                                "text": "Лучше индицировать возможную ошибку заменой цвета фона этого элемента, скажем, на розовый."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2266caaf-e66e-4832-8d94-661c07c052ec",
                                "sense_id": "0337f8ba-9827-3104-a493-a776dfcd03eb",
                                "text": "В этом режиме микропроцессор автоматически генерирует внутреннее прерывание после выполнения каждой команды с переходом к соответствующей подпрограмме обработки, которая может, например, индицировать содержимое внутренних регистров."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e73ca4bf-d95e-3c30-b35a-21c804dc4812",
                        "entry_id": "f402206f-dcfa-328b-9f09-43695657ff83",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. то же, что индексировать; производить индексацию"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c7d452a-52fa-45f9-93cb-761f3a64d66f",
                        "source_entry_id": "f402206f-dcfa-328b-9f09-43695657ff83",
                        "target_lang_word": "indicate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "indicate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To point out; to discover; to direct to a knowledge of; to show; to make known."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fc03d51-8f5e-4fc3-8282-7701fd7a563b",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "The guard blew his whistle to indicate imminent departure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa0a9b5f-352d-4432-8f63-69a69ba39735",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "With just the turn of a shoulder she indicated the water front, where, at the end of the dock on which they stood, lay the good ship, Mount Vernon, river packet, the black smoke already pouring from her stacks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5faba48-46e6-46e9-a5ff-a4c338165be5",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "The story struck the depressingly familiar note with which true stories ring in the tried ears of experienced policemen.[…]The second note, the high alarum, not so familiar and always important since it indicates the paramount sin in Man's private calendar, took most of them by surprise although they had been well prepared."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a36403b9-1b6b-4fa3-b0a7-4d6700793bb4",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "Many genes with reproductive roles also have antibacterial and immune functions, which indicate that the threat of microbial attack on the sperm or egg may be a major influence on rapid evolution during reproduction."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b31ef3c-5bae-361a-8a49-9e79b0083323",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To show or manifest by symptoms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaf02a7c-468b-465f-8439-01b1b51d539c",
                                                "sense_id": "3b31ef3c-5bae-361a-8a49-9e79b0083323",
                                                "text": "Great prostration of strength indicates the use of stimulants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78105a9f-4aeb-3d74-bb99-1e27bfcdfab8",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To point to as the proper remedies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ace279e7-3a0b-497a-b194-3f6d1a32121c",
                                                "sense_id": "78105a9f-4aeb-3d74-bb99-1e27bfcdfab8",
                                                "text": "It was strange to buy things I used to consider luxuries but were now medically indicated, like air conditioning and well-made shoes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "953a57d6-77c7-3113-a5c0-eeb7499a0edc",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To signal in a vehicle the desire to turn right or left."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To investigate the condition or power of, as of steam engine, by means of an indicator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40bbaa8d-7a7c-4c5c-810f-f020aaa90387",
                                                "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                                "text": "To a person who is familiar with the use of an indicator, whether it be of one make or another, it is needless to give instructions as to how an engine should be indicated,[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2b76e4d-a27e-4114-aa35-f14265512a7e",
                                                "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                                "text": "I found it fully as easy to indicate an engine at a speed of 320 to 340 revolutions as at 80."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97fc1942-5e01-4896-8ea3-34c5410e5762",
                                                "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                                "text": "An indicator will give the working of these valves at all times and soon return its cost in higher engine efficiency. The day has passed when it was only the expert who could indicate an engine or afford to own an indicator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5be9289b-596d-45a6-a63d-f6bf4131402b",
                        "source_entry_id": "f402206f-dcfa-328b-9f09-43695657ff83",
                        "target_lang_word": "index",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "index",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ee658ba-1a61-3b34-b021-e889da417f31",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An alphabetical listing of items and their location."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36076416-6b53-4f63-ad10-0a3e793d96dd",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee658ba-1a61-3b34-b021-e889da417f31",
                                                "text": "The index of a book lists words or expressions and the pages of the book upon which they are to be found."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81ce44b9-8d04-4077-a2d0-f1f575b74c10",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee658ba-1a61-3b34-b021-e889da417f31",
                                                "text": "He isn't able to find the index of the book."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33b632f5-e5a9-3e70-96ef-a8bfc4ca70bb",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The index finger; the forefinger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb279452-4976-352e-a0bc-6ab7dcace347",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A movable finger on a gauge, scale, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28ba1624-e1ce-38f5-bf14-318bf2e5542f",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A symbol resembling a pointing hand, used to direct particular attention to a note or paragraph."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d77b52c-c73c-3298-bc19-bd26404d171d",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which points out; that which shows, indicates, manifests, or discloses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7c36120-653c-48f0-be7d-62dee2fce739",
                                                "sense_id": "9d77b52c-c73c-3298-bc19-bd26404d171d",
                                                "text": "Tastes are the Indexes of the different Qualities of Plants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4df81540-21b6-319b-81c2-9cbb95593ffd",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sign; an indication; a token."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ffe67c4-1be8-4d9c-99c7-bc62dc7905f5",
                                                "sense_id": "4df81540-21b6-319b-81c2-9cbb95593ffd",
                                                "text": "His son's empty guffaws […] struck him with pain as the indices of a weak mind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eb9585f-9ae2-4d39-aa36-a2e84d5e1d52",
                                                "sense_id": "4df81540-21b6-319b-81c2-9cbb95593ffd",
                                                "text": "Their use of these words as epithets is an index of an appallingly low level of feminist awareness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ea6ed27-4b26-3979-a529-dc9498fbf25c",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of noun where the meaning of the form changes with respect to the context; e.g., 'Today's newspaper' is an indexical form since its referent will differ depending on the context. See also icon and symbol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72dec016-efa0-38a2-a99b-69891d048c34",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A single number calculated from an array of prices or of quantities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b837482c-6654-3969-9af4-7fc763d39da3",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A number representing a property or ratio; a coefficient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f439a80-6097-4fcc-be10-0b8c32e77016",
                                                "sense_id": "b837482c-6654-3969-9af4-7fc763d39da3",
                                                "text": "In other words, we predict that the index for a new pair of materials can be obtained from the indexes of the individual materials, both against air or against vacuum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80a867a1-e4bb-3006-94fe-3b7ce3319572",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A raised suffix indicating a power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aae7c19e-40f2-3afd-be90-e37335f515f9",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An integer or other key indicating the location of data, e.g. within an array, vector, database table, associative array, or hash table."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8857ca23-f7f6-342d-b24e-722845c5ce63",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A data structure that improves the performance of operations on a table."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35fd46c8-0d19-336a-8545-7b1d7eff6a06",
                                        "entry_id": "711cb6ac-a584-3850-b545-ed9e1eb9f143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The number of cosets that exist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
